 </header>\n\n                \n    <div class=\""u-js-hide\"" data-component=\""article-subject-links\"">\n        <h3 class=\""c-article__sub-heading\"">Subjects</h3>\n        <ul class=\""c-article-subject-list\"">\n            <li class=\""c-article-subject-list__subject\""><a href=\""/subjects/cancer\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""view subject\"" data-track-label=\""link\"">Cancer</a></li><li class=\""c-article-subject-list__subject\""><a href=\""/subjects/cancer-imaging\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""view subject\"" data-track-label=\""link\"">Cancer imaging</a></li><li class=\""c-article-subject-list__subject\""><a href=\""/subjects/databases\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""view subject\"" data-track-label=\""link\"">Databases</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n                \n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n                \n\n            </div>\n\n        <div class=\""c-article-body\"">\n            \n\n            \n                \n                    <div class=\""js-context-bar-sticky-point-mobile\"" data-track-context=\""article body\"">\n                            \n        <div class=\""c-nature-box c-nature-box--side c-nature-box--access-to-pdf\"" data-test=\""entitlement-box\"">\n        \n            <div>\n                <a href=\""https://wayf.springernature.com?redirect_uri&#x3D;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nature.com%2Farticles%2Fs41591-022-01798-z\"" class=\""c-article__button\"" data-test=\""ra21\"">\n                    <svg class=\""u-icon\"" width=\""18\"" height=\""18\"" aria-hidden=\""true\"" focusable=\""false\""><use href=\""#icon-institution\""></use></svg>\n                    <span class=\""c-article__button-text\"">Access through your institution</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        \n        \n            \n                <div data-test=\""entitlement-box-buy-button\"">\n                    <a href=\""#access-options\"" class=\""c-article__button c-article__button--inverted\"" data-test=\""ra21\"">\n                        <span>Buy or subscribe</span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            \n        \n        </div>\n    \n\n                    </div>\n                \n            \n\n            \n                \n                <div class=\""article__teaser\""><p><b>To the Editor</b> — The capability to gather large amounts of data, alongside the increasing power of artificial intelligence to examine it, has led to a revolution in the use of data in the life sciences. We announce a new initiative, the Genomics Pathology Imaging Collection (GPIC), combining digital pathology and genomic data to create a unique multi-omic resource for cancer research.</p><p>This collaboration between Genomics England and the UK National Pathology Imaging Co-operative (NPIC) builds on the rich data of the 100,000 Genomes Project to add over 250,000 additional digital pathology images and associated pathology information.</p></div>\n                \n                \n                    <div class=\""c-article-access-provider u-mb-32 u-mt-0\"">\n                        <p class=\""c-article-access-provider__text u-sans-serif\"">This is a preview of subscription content, <a href=\""https://wayf.springernature.com?redirect_uri&#x3D;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nature.com%2Farticles%2Fs41591-022-01798-z\"" data-track=\""click_institution_login\"" data-track-context=\""article body link\""\n                         data-track-action=\""institution access preview subscription\"" data-track-label=\""link\"">access via your institution</a></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                        \n     <script>\n         if (window.dataLayer) {\n             window.dataLayer.push({\n                 content: { article: { relevantArticlesCount: 2 }}\n             })\n         }\n     </script>\n    \n        <section>\n            <div class=\""c-article-section js-article-section\"" id=\""relevant-content-section\