 of Pathologists, and is the principal investigator of the NPIC program (UKRI). All other authors declare no competing interests.</p>\n              \n            </div></div></section><section data-title=\""Rights and permissions\""><div class=\""c-article-section\"" id=\""rightslink-section\""><h2 class=\""c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item\"" id=\""rightslink\"">Rights and permissions</h2><div class=\""c-article-section__content\"" id=\""rightslink-content\""><p class=\""c-article-rights\""><a data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""view rights and permissions\"" data-track-label=\""link\"" href=\""https://s100.copyright.com/AppDispatchServlet?title=Bridging%20the%20gap%20with%20the%20UK%20Genomics%20Pathology%20Imaging%20Collection&amp;author=Charlotte%20N.%20Jennings%20et%20al&amp;contentID=10.1038%2Fs41591-022-01798-z&amp;copyright=The%20Author%28s%29%2C%20under%20exclusive%20licence%20to%20Springer%20Nature%20America%2C%20Inc.&amp;publication=1078-8956&amp;publicationDate=2022-05-09&amp;publisherName=SpringerNature&amp;orderBeanReset=true\"">Reprints and permissions</a></p></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\""article-info\"" data-title=\""About this article\""><div class=\""c-article-section\"" id=\""article-info-section\""><h2 class=\""c-article-section__title js-section-title js-c-reading-companion-sections-item\"" id=\""article-info\"">About this article</h2><div class=\""c-article-section__content\"" id=\""article-info-content\""><div class=\""c-bibliographic-information\""><div class=\""u-hide-print c-bibliographic-information__column c-bibliographic-information__column--border\""><a data-crossmark=\""10.1038/s41591-022-01798-z\"" target=\""_blank\"" rel=\""noopener\"" href=\""https://crossmark.crossref.org/dialog/?doi=10.1038/s41591-022-01798-z\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""Click Crossmark\"" data-track-label=\""link\"" data-test=\""crossmark\""><img loading=\""lazy\"" width=\