s=\""c-article-author-list__item\""><a data-test=\""author-name\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""open author\"" data-track-label=\""link\"" data-track-index=\""1_1\"" data-track-context=\""researcher popup with no profile\"" href=\""#auth-Moritz-Schaefer-Aff1-Aff2-Aff3-Aff4-Aff5\"" data-author-popup=\""auth-Moritz-Schaefer-Aff1-Aff2-Aff3-Aff4-Aff5\"" data-author-search=\""Schaefer, Moritz\"" data-corresp-id=\""c1\"">Moritz Schaefer<svg width=\""16\"" height=\""16\"" focusable=\""false\"" role=\""img\"" aria-hidden=\""true\"" class=\""u-icon\""><use xmlns:xlink=\""http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"" xlink:href=\""#icon-eds-i-mail-medium\""></use></svg></a><span class=\""u-js-hide\""> \n            <a class=\""js-orcid\"" href=\""https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6489-1947\""><span class=\""u-visually-hidden\"">ORCID: </span>orcid.org/0000-0001-6489-1947</a></span><sup class=\""u-js-hide\""><a href=\""#Aff1\"">1</a>,<a href=\""#Aff2\"">2</a>,<a href=\""#Aff3\"">3</a>,<a href=\""#Aff4\"">4</a>,<a href=\""#Aff5\"">5</a></sup> </li></ul>\n\n                    \n                        \n                    \n\n                    <p class=\""c-article-info-details\"" data-container-section=\""info\"">\n                        \n    <a data-test=\""journal-link\"" href=\""/nrg\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""journal homepage\"" data-track-category=\""article body\"" data-track-label=\""link\""><i data-test=\""journal-title\"">Nature Reviews Genetics</i></a>\n\n                        <b data-test=\""journal-volume\""><span class=\""u-visually-hidden\"">volume</span> 27</b>, <span class=\""u-visually-hidden\"">page </span>189 (<span data-test=\""article-publication-year\"">2026</span>)<a href=\""#citeas\"" class=\""c-article-info-details__cite-as u-hide-print\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""cite this article\"" data-track-label=\""link\"">Cite this article</a>\n                    </p>\n                    \n        \n        <div class=\""c-article-metrics-bar__wrapper u-clear-both\"">\n            <ul class=\""c-article-metrics-bar u-list-reset\"">\n                \n                    <li class=\"" c-article-metrics-bar__item\"" data-test=\""access-count\"">\n                        <p class=\""c-article-metrics-bar__count\"">1786 <span class=\""c-article-metrics-bar__label\"">Accesses</span></p>\n                    </li>\n                \n                \n                \n                    \n                        <li class=\""c-article-metrics-bar__item\"" data-test=\""altmetric-score\"">\n                            <p class=\""c-article-metrics-bar__count\"">3 <span class=\""c-article-metrics-bar__label\"">Altmetric</span></p>\n                        </li>\n                    \n                \n                \n                    <li class=\""c-article-metrics-bar__item\"">\n                        <p class=\""c-article-metrics-bar__details\""><a href=\""/articles/s41576-025-00927-x/metrics\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""view metrics\"" data-track-label=\""link\"" rel=\""nofollow\"">Metrics <span class=\""u-visually-hidden\"">details</span></a></p>\n                    </li>\n                \n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    \n                    \n                </header>\n\n                \n    <div class=\""u-js-hide\"" data-component=\""article-subject-links\"">\n        <h3 class=\""c-article__sub-heading\"">Subjects</h3>\n        <ul class=\""c-article-subject-list\"">\n            <li class=\""c-article-subject-list__subject\""><a href=\""/subjects/machine-learning\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""view subject\"" data-track-label=\""link\"">Machine learning</a></li><li class=\""c-article-subject-list__subject\""><a href=\""/subjects/rna-sequencing\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""view subject\"" data-track-label=\""link\"">RNA sequencing</a></li><li class=\""c-article-subject-list__subject\""><a href=\""/subjects/software\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""view subject\"" data-track-label=\""link\"">Software</a></li><li class=\""c-article-subject-list__subject\""><a href=\""/subjects/transcriptomics\"" data-track=\""click\"" data-track-action=\""view subject\"" data-track-label=\""link\"">Transcriptomics</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n                \n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n                \n\n            </div>\n\n        <div class=\""c-article-body\"">\n            \n\n            \n                \n                    <div class=\""js-context-bar-sticky-point-mobile\"" data-track-context=\""article body\"">\n                            \n        <div class=\""c-nature-box c-nature-box--side c-nature-box--access-to-pdf\"" data-test=\""entitlement-box\"">\n        \n            <div>\n                <a href=\""https://wayf.springernature.com?redirect_uri&#x3D;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nature.com%2Farticles%2Fs41576-025-00927-x\"" class=\""c-article__button\"" data-test=\""ra21\"">\n                    <svg class=\""u-icon\"" width=\""18\"" height=\""18\"" aria-hidden=\""true\"" focusable=\""false\""><use href=\""#icon-institution\""></use></svg>\n                    <span class=\""c-article__button-text\"">Access through your institution</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        \n        \n            \n                <div data-test=\""entitlement-box-buy-button\"">\n                    <a href=\""#access-options\"" class=\""c-article__button c-article__button--inverted\"" data-test=\""ra21\"">\n                        <span>Buy or subscribe</span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            \n        \n        </div>\n    \n\n                    </div>\n                \n            \n\n            \n                \n                <div class=\""article__teaser\""><p>Single-cell RNA sequencing (scRNA-seq) captures the state of thousands of cells simultaneously, establishing it as a cornerstone assay in modern biomedical research. Yet, interpreting the resulting data relies on specialized software tools and on writing code. As a result, scRNA-seq analysis has been largely confined to bioinformaticians, creating a bottleneck in scientific workflows. The emergence of multimodal language models, such as ChatGPT and Gemini, offers a perspective to overcome this obstacle through intuitive, language-based data exploration.</p><p>CellWhisperer is particularly valuable for initial data exploration, as it provides immediate insights from raw read count profiles. In a comparison with conventional bioinformatics analysis of colon cells, CellWhisperer reached similar conclusions four times faster. It also enabled the mapping of organ formation over time in a human development atlas and identified previously unknown developmental markers for the heart and other organs. These findings underscore the potential of CellWhisperer to capture new and compelling biological insights.</p></div>\n                \n                \n                    <div class=\""c-article-access-provider u-mb-32 u-mt-0\"">\n                        <p class=\""c-article-access-provider__text u-sans-serif\"">This is a preview of subscription content, <a href=\""https://wayf.springernature.com?redirect_uri&#x3D;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nature.com%2Farticles%2Fs41576-025-00927-x\"" data-track=\""click_institution_login\"" data-track-context=\""article body link\""\n                         data-track-action=\""institution access preview subscription\"" data-track-label=\""link\"">access via your institution</a></p>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                        \n     <script>\n         if (window.dataLayer) {\n             window.dataLayer.push({\n                 content: { article: { relevantArticlesCount: 0 }}\n             })\n         }\n     </script>\n    \n\n                    \n                \n\n                \n\n                <h2 class=\""c-article-section__title u-h2 u-mb-24\"" id=\""