./data/living_catalog/taxonomy_rerun_preflight_2026-08-12/taxonomy/runs/classification_dense/shard_02/records/full_2026-07-06__rec_003206_211e7d00b696/full_2026_07_06_rec_003206_211e7d00b696_docling_json_20260812_215730/docling/document.json:7006:      "orig": "[42] Fan Yang et al. 'scBERT as a large-scale pretrained deep language model for cell type annotation of single-cell RNA-seq data'. In: Nature Machine Intelligence 4.10 (2022), pp. 852866.",
